<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>’Twas after we believed in Christ,</l><l>The word of truth, the gospel, heard,</l><l>The Holy Spirit us did seal</l><l>To show that we belong to God.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>This Spirit as the living seal,</l><l>To us God’s image now imparts;</l><l>Conforming us unto the Son,</l><l>He stamps His image in our hearts.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>This Spirit also is the pledge,</l><l>Our earnest and our foretaste true.</l><l>He witnesses that we are sons,</l><l>With God’s inheritance in view.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>’Tis by this Spirit God does spread</l><l>Into our mind, emotion, will;</l><l>By sealing every inward part,</l><l>He will our very being fill.</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>Oh Lord, we would cooperate</l><l>With all Thy Spirit’s inward move;</l><l>That we’d become Thy masterpiece,</l><l>Th’ eternal purpose thus to prove.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
